Bootstrap and Glyphicons Halflings

web/css/bootstrap.css and web/js/bootstrap.js are Bootstrap 3.3.5.
web/css/bootstrap*.min.css and web/js/bootstrap.min.js are Bootstrap 4.3.1.
Both are licensed under the MIT License below.

Upstream source:
  https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap

web/fonts/glyphicons-halflings-regular.* is the GLYPHICONS Halflings font
(Copyright 2014 Jan Kovarik, https://glyphicons.com), which Bootstrap 3.3.5
includes. Its creator made it available for Bootstrap free of cost.

web/css/bootstrap.css includes normalize.css 3.0.3, and
web/css/bootstrap.min.css and web/css/bootstrap-reboot.min.css include Reboot,
which is forked from normalize.css.
normalize.css is licensed under the MIT License below.

Upstream source:
  https://github.com/necolas/normalize.css

